WEBVTT

00:01:27.063 --> 00:01:31.130
But what if we could all be a little
bit more like them now?

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:32.763
Not everybody can be inventor.

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:36.797
That takes a lot of technical talent
and expertise in many,

00:01:36.797 --> 00:01:41.230
many years of studying. But what if
we could all become entrepreneurs

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:45.397
and disruptors who turned their
ideas into reality?

00:01:45.697 --> 00:01:49.797
That's what I set out to do when I
joined Pioneer to do my Ph.D. at

00:01:49.797 --> 00:01:51.130
the University of Lausanne.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:57.697
I've had this idea that maybe we could
design business models like architects,

00:01:57.897 --> 00:02:01.930
design buildings. And one of the things
that came out of her research was